# CODEOWNERS - the required-approver list, enforced natively by GitHub.
#
# Every PR into a branch whose protection enables "require code owner review"
# (development, staging, main) must have an approving review from one of the
# people below. All three are code owners on every branch, so any one of them
# can approve a PR into any branch. The file is identical on every branch, so
# there is no drift to manage across promotions.
#
# Who can MERGE is controlled separately by branch-protection push restrictions
# (staging: all three; main: yelserafy + Salma-Eissa). GitHub blocks approving
# your own PR, so the author still needs one of the others to approve.
